      151.29,
      362.89,
      450.58,
      373.96
    ],
    "text": "FILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF A MEMBER OF THE",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      192.57,
      373.93,
      409.28,
      407.08
    ],
    "text": "PUTTALAM URBAN COUNCILUNDER SECTION 65A(2) OF THELOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      152.25,
      407.05,
      449.37,
      429.16
    ],
    "text": "(CHAPTER 262) AS AMENDED BYLOCAL AUTHORITIES (SPECIAL PROVISIONS) ACT, No 30 OF 2013",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.05,
      450.97,
      490.96,
      462.04
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS the office of a member in Puttalam Urban Council has fallen vacant by reason of Resignation ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.05,
      473.05,
      546.59,
      517.0
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the Group of the Independent Group No. 08 to which the Member, Mr. M. A. R. Alisabrybelonged, was required by me under Section 65A(2) as amended by the Local Authorities Elections (Amendment) Act, No. 16of 2007, to nominate a person eligible under the Ordinance to appoint as a member of that Puttalam Urban Council withina period of thirty (30) days ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.05,
      528.01,
      546.62,
      550.12
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the Group leader of the Independent Group has nominated Mr. Wasala Mudiyanselage SenaviratnaWasala Bandara being an eligible person under the aforesiad Ordinance of fill such vacancy ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.05,
      560.89,
      546.62,
      605.08
    ],
    "text": "NOW THEREFORE, I, Pakkiyarajah Ragunathan Returning Officer of Puttalam Urban Council, acting in terms ofSection 65A(2) (b) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance as amended by Filling of Vacancies in Local Authorities(Special Provisions) Act No. 30 of 2013 (Chapter 262) do hereby declare Mr. Wasala Mudiyanselage Senaviratna WasalaBandara elected as a member of the Puttalam Urban Council.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      434.73,
      605.05,
      545.71,
      616.12
    ],
    "text": "PAKKIYARAJAH RAGUNATHAN,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.05,
      616.09,
      538.42,
      671.08
    ],
